cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use splatx-metal in your research, please cite the repository, and
  please also cite the works it builds on: the gsplat library (whose numerics
  this project reproduces) and the original 3D Gaussian Splatting paper.
title: "splatx-metal: 3D Gaussian Splatting training on Apple Silicon"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "POSTMEDIA"
repository-code: "https://github.com/POSTMEDIA/splatx-metal"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - gaussian-splatting
  - metal
  - apple-silicon
  - radiance-fields
  - machine-learning
